<title>USA: Meditrust hires Laurie Tidor CFO.</title>
<headline>Meditrust hires Laurie Tidor CFO.</headline>
<dateline>NEEDHAM HEIGHTS, Mass. 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Meditrust said it hired Laurie Tidor as chief finacial officer to replace Lisa McAlister, who left the company in October to take another job.</p>
<p>Tidor, 38, will begin her job with Meditrust on December 16, the company said.</p>
<p>Her last job was as a partner at Coopers &amp; Lybrand, where she spent 14 years, the company added.</p>
